<title>NEW ZEALAND: CONSENSUS-Survey of RBNZ Monetary Policy Survey.</title>
<headline>CONSENSUS-Survey of RBNZ Monetary Policy Survey.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand's June Monetary Policy Statement is due on Friday.</p>
<p>The following survey results give economists' average expectations for the RBNZ's projections.</p>
<p>Please see the &quot;Further information&quot; sections at the end for the number of respondents, range and median of forecasts.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>SHORT TERM PROJECTIONS</p>
<p>(Quarterly percentage changes, unless otherwise specified)</p>
<p>						    RBNZ PROJECTIONS</p>
<p>				     JUN 97    SEP 97    DEC 97   MAR 98</p>
<p>				     ------    ------    ------   ------</p>
<p>  a Core inflation	     0.35	0.26	0.21     0.24</p>
<p>  b Nominal MCI (1000 base)  887.1     844.6     807.6    808.2</p>
<p>c Exchange rate (TWI)	67.71     67.3	66.94    66.88</p>
<p>  d 90-day bank bill yield   7.21	7.23	7.13     7.28</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>ECONOMIC PROJECTIONS</p>
<p>(March yr annual pct changes, unless otherwise specified)</p>
<p>						    RBNZ PROJECTIONS</p>
<p>					     1998	 1999	2000</p>
<p>					     ----	 ----	----</p>
<p>  e Core inflation		     1.14	 1.38	1.64</p>
<p>  f Consumer Price Index (CPI)     0.8	  1.54	1.80</p>
<p>  g Nominal MCI			  839.6	885	 921.8</p>
<p>  h Exchange rate (TWI)		67.23	n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  i 90-day bank bill yield	   7.24	 n/a	 n/a</p>
<p>  j Real GDP (production)	    2.04	 3.42	2.78</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Economists were also asked: In interest rate terms, by how many basis points do you expect the conditions assumed by the bank as appropriate now, i.e. on Friday, to differ from those assumed in the March economic projections?</p>
<p>Respondents: Nine</p>
<p>Average forecast: 69.44 basis points easier</p>
<p>Range: 50-100 basis points easier</p>
<p>Median: 75 basis points easier</p>
<p>Mode: 75 basis points easier</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
